  "steps": [
    "Chop all vegetables. Mix soy sauce, oyster sauce, honey and garlic powder. Mix cornstarch with 50g cold water.",
    "Fry ground beef in 2g oil 2 minutes; remove. Add mushrooms with 50g water; saut\u00e9 until collapsed (4\u20135 min), then fry until coloured.",
    "Add remaining vegetables; fry 2\u20133 minutes. Boil udon noodles 3 minutes; drain.",
    "Transfer noodles to the pan. Add sauce and cornstarch slurry; stir until thickened. Return beef. Done!"
